Cho-cho, isn't it cute? Cho-cho, answer me!

244
00:27:03,190 --> 00:27:05,740
ちょっちょっ 寂しいな それじゃ私もイタズラだ！
Cho-cho, so lonely... Then I'll play tricks too!

245
00:27:29,540 --> 00:27:32,240
全身小悪魔 精神性 フローラル柑橘香水系
Full-body little devil, mental state, floral citrus perfume vibe!

246
00:27:32,390 --> 00:27:34,390
容姿ヤバい 恋まで発展わっつ！
Appearance is dangerous, developing straight into love, what?!

247
00:27:34,590 --> 00:27:36,940
イジワルしちゃうぞしちゃうぞ 冷めちゃいイヤ
I'm gonna be so mean, so mean... Don't let things cool down!

248
